Location

Ethereum Mainnet

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Protokol lending live dengan 6 aset awal, TVL awal ~$0.

Sources

https://blog.compound.finance/compound-v1-is-live-on-mainnet-8b8e8c8c8c8c

